WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.990
Arus splits large files into several parts and downloads them at the same time.

2
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:09.097
That keeps transfers fast, even when a file is several gigabytes.

3
00:00:09.097 --> 00:00:11.497
Click New download in the main window.

4
00:00:11.497 --> 00:00:13.708
Paste the file link into the field.

5
00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:17.119
Choose a save folder, and rename the file if you like.

6
00:00:17.119 --> 00:00:20.910
Arus adds it to the queue and splits the file automatically.

7
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.384
You don't have to manage parts or connections yourself.

8
00:00:24.384 --> 00:00:25.963
Need to stop for a while?

9
00:00:25.963 --> 00:00:28.932
Press Pause, then Resume whenever you're ready.

10
00:00:28.932 --> 00:00:31.270
Arus continues without starting over.

11
00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:36.955
Every download has a details page with speed, time left, size, and the connections in use.

12
00:00:36.955 --> 00:00:40.177
Click any download to open its details at any time.

13
00:00:40.177 --> 00:00:44.093
You can also open the save folder right from the details page.

14
00:00:44.093 --> 00:00:48.578
When it finishes, a notification appears and the file is ready to open.

15
00:00:48.578 --> 00:00:52.432
Your history stays tidy, with search and categories built in.

16
00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:55.780
Use search or categories to find older files quickly.

17
00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.507
Big files stay easy to manage, even when the queue is busy.

